; mdlex64.sys, the build for XP Professional x64 (installed there as mdlex.sys): the same exports
; as mdlex.def, which x64 does not decorate. The x64 dmvsc.sys is bound to it for
; MmAddPhysicalMemory only, since XP x64's kernel has a usable MmAllocatePagesForMdlEx of its own
; (hvkit's dmvsc recipe says why); that export stays so that both builds are the same driver.
LIBRARY mdlex.sys
EXPORTS
    MmAllocatePagesForMdlEx
    MmAddPhysicalMemory
